<section class="prayer-day sec" id="prayer-day" data-od-id="prayer-day" aria-label="A day held by salah">
  <div class="wrap prayer-day-grid">
    <div class="pd-copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">A day held by salah</span>
      <h2>From adhan to unlock, the whole flow feels <span class="it">Muslim.</span></h2>
      <p>Barakah is built around the lived rhythm of salah: a gentle threshold at adhan, useful tools during the window, and a quiet return after prayer.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pd-board reveal d1" aria-label="Barakah prayer day product states">
      <div class="pd-row current">
        <div class="pd-time">
          <strong>Fajr</strong>
          <small>Before the day begins</small>
        </div>
        <div class="pd-state">
          <span class="pd-pill calm">Lock prepared</span>
          <p>Sleep apps and video stay quiet until the window closes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pd-row">
        <div class="pd-time">
          <strong>Dhuhr</strong>
          <small>Workday reset</small>
        </div>
        <div class="pd-state">
          <span class="pd-pill">Allowed tools</span>
          <p>Calls, maps, Qur'an, qibla and emergency tools remain available.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pd-row active">
        <div class="pd-time">
          <strong>Maghrib</strong>
          <small>Now</small>
        </div>
        <div class="pd-state">
          <span class="pd-pill gold">Apps resting</span>
          <p>Social, reels and games are held behind a calm mihrab screen.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pd-row">
        <div class="pd-time">
          <strong>Isha</strong>
          <small>Evening close</small>
        </div>
        <div class="pd-state">
          <span class="pd-pill dhikr">After salah</span>
          <p>Tasbih appears, then the phone returns without a score or streak.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
